            "sid": "JOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua akarudi wakati huo na kuutwaa Hazori, akampiga mfalme wa Hazori kwa upanga; kwa kuwa Hazori hapo awali ulikuwa ni kichwa cha falme hizo zote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wakawapiga wote pia waliokuwamo ndani ya Hazori kwa makali ya upanga, wakawaangamiza kabisa; hakubakizwa hata mmoja akiwa hai; kisha akauteketeza Hazori kwa moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:12"
